03578186],"scale":[1,0.9999999403953552,1.0000001192092896],"translation":[-9.484210750088096e-09,0.40733101963996887,-2.0954757928848267e-09]},{"children":[48],"name":"calf_r","rotation":[0.058844517916440964,-0.2321772277355194,0.008530084043741226,0.9708544611930847],"scale":[0.9999998807907104,0.9999997615814209,0.9999999403953552],"translation":[-5.587935447692871e-09,0.39470696449279785,7.450580596923828e-09]},{"children":[49],"name":"thigh_r","rotation":[-0.958074688911438,0.09174000471830368,-0.2139034867286682,0.16709880530834198],"scale":[0.9999998211860657,0.9999999403953552,0.9999985098838806],"translation":[-0.10147152096033096,-0.003829043358564377,-0.010990308597683907]},{"children":[42,46,50],"name":"pelvis","rotation":[0.5305899977684021,-1.5553862193127784e-16,-3.88809262563683e-10,0.8476285934448242],"translation":[0,-0.013216575607657433,0.8744488954544067]},{"children":[51],"name":"Root","rotation":[-0.7071067690849304,0,0,0.7071067690849304],"translation":[0,-0.0005625183694064617,6.100162863731384e-08]},{"mesh":0,"name":"Body","skin":0},{"mesh":1,"name":"Eyebrows","skin":0},{"mesh":2,"name":"Eyelashes","skin":0},{"mesh":3,"name":"Eyes","skin":0},{"mesh":4,"name":"Teeth","skin":0},{"mesh":5,"name":"Tongue","skin":0},{"children":[53,54,55,56,57,58,52,60,61,62,63,64],"name":"Elizabeth Osei","extras":{"persona":{"residentId":"AH-R0459","personId":"AH-R0459","name":"Elizabeth Osei","age":68,"occupation":"Retired maternity orderly","home":"Midtown","episode":"The button card","biography":"stories/residents/04/01-the-button-card.md#ah-r0459","life":"“I still remember an old nurse adjusting her own swollen cuff.” People around the market by Market Flats know Elizabeth by a small Sunday habit. Elizabeth often waits until the delivery baskets are stacked before going in.","voice":"I can identify the old maternity uniforms by their flat-backed buttons. I wore one through both winters.","appearance":"Elizabeth has a heart-shaped face and prominent ears. Look for tightly curled gray hair. On an ordinary day, the familiar outfit is an unlined tan jacket with a little coil of soft measuring tape. In conversation Elizabeth looks down for a moment before saying something difficult.","personality":"Elizabeth has an appetite for a good argument about little things and works hard to keep a serious disagreement from being turned into entertainment.","agenda":"To recognize the old maternity workers beyond their uniforms.","family":"Sam Fox is Elizabeth’s younger cousin. Elizabeth asks before bringing somebody along. Sam can always ask for five minutes alone. It keeps a conversation between two people from unexpectedly turning into a family committee. Asked about *Two names on the chart*, Sam says, “I copied her old hospital number onto a holiday card once.”","connections":"Benjamin Lewis. A child's costume moon survives beside an older worker's maternity buttons.","familyIds":["AH-R1107"],"connectionIds":["AH-R0453"],"reactions":[{"situation":"A child takes the most valuable button","response":"Elizabeth lets the child show what the button is for before calling it too valuable.","asWritten":"A child takes the most valuable button. Elizabeth lets the child show what the button is for before calling it too valuable."},{"situation":"A coworker arrives late after a night at the hospital","response":"Elizabeth takes one immediate task off their hands and asks when they want to tell the supervisor.","asWritten":"A coworker arrives late after a night at the hospital. Elizabeth takes one immediate task off their hands and asks when they want to tell the supervisor."},{"situation":"When a private quarrel becomes a public joke","response":"Elizabeth says the plainest truthful thing possible and changes the subject.","asWritten":"When a private quarrel becomes a public joke, Elizabeth says the plainest truthful thing possible and changes the subject."}]},"appearanceSource":"biography casting design"}},{"mesh":6,"name":"Hair_bob01","skin":0},{"mesh":7,"name":"Cloth_jacket","skin":0},{"mesh":8,"name":"Cloth_tshirt","skin":0},{"mesh":9,"name":"Cloth_jeans","skin":0},{"mesh":10,"name":"Cloth_shoes","skin":0}],"meshes":[{"name":"base","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_female","age_old","weight_min","muscle_min","height_short","face_nose_width_incr","face_nose_length_incr","face_nose_height_incr","face_jaw_width_incr","face_chin_incr","face_cheekbones_decr","face_eye_size_decr","face_eye_spacing_decr","face_eye_tilt_incr","face_lips_decr","face_ear_size_incr","face_forehead_decr","blink_left","blink_right","corr_gender_female__age_old","corr_weight_min__muscle_min","corr_gender_female__muscle_min","corr_gender_female__weight_min"]},"weights":[0.1323,0.75,0.4774,0.3734,0.4465,0.3448,0.1735,0.1267,0.1554,0.57,0.3758,0.3685,0.332,0.3206,0.3494,0.78,0.0821,0,0,0.09923,0.17826,0.0494,0.06316],"primitives":[{"attributes":{"POSITION":2,"NORMAL":3,"TEXCOORD_0":4,"JOINTS_0":5,"WEIGHTS_0":6},"indices":1,"material":0,"targets":[{"POSITION":7,"NORMAL":8},{"POSITION":9,"NORMAL":10},{"POSITION":11,"NORMAL":12},{"POSITION":13,"NORMAL":14},{"POSITION":15,"NORMAL":16},{"POSITION":17,"NORMAL":18},{"POSITION":19,"NORMAL":20},{"POSITION":21,"NORMAL":22},{"POSITION":23,"NORMAL":24},{"POSITION":25,"NORMAL":26},{"POSITION":27,"NORMAL":28},{"POSITION":29,"NORMAL":30},{"POSITION":31,"NORMAL":32},{"POSITION":33,"NORMAL":34},{"POSITION":35,"NORMAL":36},{"POSITION":37,"NORMAL":38},{"POSITION":39,"NORMAL":40},{"POSITION":41,"NORMAL":42},{"POSITION":43,"NORMAL":44},{"POSITION":45,"NORMAL":46},{"POSITION":47,"NORMAL":48},{"POSITION":49,"NORMAL":50},{"POSITION":51,"NORMAL":52}]}]},{"name":"Eyebrows","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_female","age_old","weight_min","muscle_min","height_short","face_nose_width_incr","face_nose_length_incr","face_nose_height_incr","face_jaw_width_incr","face_chin_incr","face_cheekbones_decr","face_eye_size_decr","face_eye_spacing_decr","face_eye_tilt_incr","face_lips_decr","face_ear_size_incr","face_forehea